PL Call Analytics — Work Documentation
Project: LLM-based compliance monitoring and transcript analytics for outbound personal loan telecalling
Regulated entity: Kotak Mahindra Bank
Volume: ~5,000 call recordings/day
Status date: 21 August 2026
1. Objective
Convert raw outbound PL call recordings into consistent, auditable, call-level labels — compliance flags, call outcome, objections, customer intent, and extracted product facts (loan amount, interest rate, EMI, tenure).
The governing constraint on the whole system: every call-level label must cite the specific transcript turn numbers that justify it. Labels without evidence spans are not acceptable for audit.
